before opening. This is visible-display evidence only, not mathematical,
source, answer, figure-fidelity or whole-lesson approval. Coordinates below
are approximate native-pixel locations from direct viewing, not measurements.

Batch status: **BLOCKED**, isolated to the unobserved 335(b) equality endpoint
in `0029`. Every legible terminal has its own PASS/VISIBLE `terminalFacts`
object in `result.json`. Off-window regions remain exclusions. The direct
`0065` witness is retained independently; it does not rewrite `0029` pixels.

